# The HUD's calls on the player's damage (spec M5): race-start.scenario on into the race with
# the test game at 75 % damage and two mines (--save 0:FILE); each mine dropped and the car
# backed over it as wreck.scenario does, the first blast leaving the car under a fifth of its
# damage bar and the second under a tenth. A shot every 250 ms; run with --no-ai --watch
# --sound (and --cfg with the music off to hear the calls).
